      "results": [
        {
          "ruleId": "CWE-862",
          "ruleIndex": 0,
          "level": "warning",
          "message": {
            "text": "Missing authorization check on user presence query.\n\nThe presence endpoint accepts user IDs from query string and passes them directly to GetStatus() without authorization checks, allowing any authenticated user to query presence of any other user.\n\nImpact: User enumeration and activity pattern disclosure - attackers can determine if specific users are online.\n\nExploit scenario: Authenticated user requests /api/v1/realtime/presence?userIds=other_user_id and receives their online status without permission.\n\nPreconditions: User is authenticated; Attacker knows target user IDs.\n\nRecommendation: Add authorization checks to ensure users can only query presence for users in the same channels/teams or add explicit permission requirements.\n\nCWE-862. Severity MEDIUM, confidence high."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "src/BuildingBlocks/Web/Realtime/HeroRealtimeExtensions.cs",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%"
